{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02379",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 5.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Right, sorry I'm a little late, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.51,
      "end_seconds": 10.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.63,
      "end_seconds": 19.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got itchy red patches that have gone crusty."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.03,
      "end_seconds": 22.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.51,
      "end_seconds": 37.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.27,
      "end_seconds": 62.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.73,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 70 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, BP is 124 over 71. How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.24,
      "end_seconds": 70.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, it's been about a month, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.11,
      "end_seconds": 80.84,
      "duration_seconds": 9.73,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.84,
      "end_seconds": 89.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "Ah, honestly, a couple of times a week. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.04,
      "end_seconds": 92.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.22,
      "end_seconds": 97.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "It usually comes with scratching at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.83,
      "end_seconds": 100.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.43,
      "end_seconds": 109.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "Hmm, it feels moderate to me. I've also had being irritable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.06,
      "end_seconds": 113.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Did you get drowsiness, blisters or high fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.29,
      "end_seconds": 118.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Okay, so no, nothing to report there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.47,
      "end_seconds": 122.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "And eating poorly, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.24,
      "end_seconds": 126.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Definitely no eating poorly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.27,
      "end_seconds": 131.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.45,
      "end_seconds": 137.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "My heart's been fine, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.67,
      "end_seconds": 142.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.02,
      "end_seconds": 149.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.27,
      "end_seconds": 163.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.02,
      "end_seconds": 168.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Actually, uh, my brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.95,
      "end_seconds": 176.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.98,
      "end_seconds": 181.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Metoprolol. I take it twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.24,
      "end_seconds": 185.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.93,
      "end_seconds": 197.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "text": "50 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. Oh, I take a moisturiser, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.93,
      "end_seconds": 202.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.55,
      "end_seconds": 205.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.27,
      "end_seconds": 207.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.9,
      "end_seconds": 215.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "I have heart disease. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.11,
      "end_seconds": 222.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "Okay, I can see eczema and heart disease in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.66,
      "end_seconds": 233.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.55,
      "end_seconds": 236.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.17,
      "end_seconds": 242.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.1,
      "end_seconds": 253.36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.26,
      "text": "I was told I'm allergic to erythromycin, but I don't remember what reaction I had."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.27,
      "end_seconds": 256.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.84,
      "end_seconds": 269.94,
      "duration_seconds": 12.1,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I've never touched a cigarette. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.01,
      "end_seconds": 274.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.03,
      "end_seconds": 278.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.87,
      "end_seconds": 298.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "The eczema patches on the arms have yellow crusts and weeping areas."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.51,
      "end_seconds": 301.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.7,
      "end_seconds": 306.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.65,
      "end_seconds": 334.46,
      "duration_seconds": 14.81,
      "text": "So where does that leave us? It points towards eczema with a bacterial skin infection. We shouldn't forget herpes simplex eczema. I'd like to arrange a skin swab for infected eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 335.04,
      "end_seconds": 339.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I can book that for Thursday at 11:30 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.58,
      "end_seconds": 343.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.17,
      "end_seconds": 361.95,
      "duration_seconds": 17.78,
      "text": "Let's use flucloxacillin, 250 milligrams, four times a day, seven days. That's for infected eczema. Keep the nails short and keep using the moisturiser. Come back in one week. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.68,
      "end_seconds": 367.95,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Good, you know, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.15,
      "end_seconds": 370.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}